{"id":1752692,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-20T11:55:54.387Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1752692,"imdb_id":"tt9112156","origin_country":["IR"],"original_language":"fa","original_title":"Missing","overview":"Once we begin to consider certain people, items, or memories as our own, we lay ourselves open to the threat that we’ll lose them. Once the loss actually occurs, our mental image of the lost thing doesn’t disappear – on the contrary – it intensifies. This documentary, inspired by the stories of missing people in Iranian newspapers, searches for people who have disappeared for various reasons, but their tracks still resonate. A wide spectrum of archival materials offers a variety of answers to the question of how the absent can remain present, while live images of grieving loved ones then act as an appeal to all those who would brush off this painful ambivalence.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/y3yxqyq6mP7HW6pO3GY2HtQLWsg.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"IR","name":"Iran"}],"release_date":"2016-03-01","revenue":0,"runtime":60,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Persian","iso_639_1":"fa","name":"فارسی"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Missing","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1523815,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Farahnaz Sharifi","original_name":"فرحناز شریفی","popularity":0.37,"profile_path":"/gARdqpeFvZCiaLVXeua9ST8Cr7F.jpg","credit_id":"6a860e91859126a5c95f0a6f","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1523815,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Farahnaz Sharifi","original_name":"فرحناز شریفی","popularity":0.37,"profile_path":"/gARdqpeFvZCiaLVXeua9ST8Cr7F.jpg","credit_id":"6a860e9a859126a5c95f0a72","department":"Editing","job":"Editor"}]},"external_id